+==== PSRL.DWS
+
+===== Encoding
+
+PSRL.DWS is encoded in the OP-IMM-32 major opcode using the double-wide
+scalar format with word elements. Available only in RV32.
+
+[wavedrom, ,svg]
+....
+{reg:[
+    { bits: 8, name: 0x1b, attr: ['OP-IMM-32'] },
+    { bits: 4, name: 'rd_p' },
+    { bits: 4, name: 0xe },
+    { bits: 4, name: 'rs1_p' },
+    { bits: 5, name: 'rs2' },
+    { bits: 2, name: 0x1 },
+    { bits: 1, name: 0x1 },
+    { bits: 3, name: 0x0, attr: ['PSRL.DWS'] },
+    { bits: 1, name: 0x0 },
+]}
+....
+
+===== Operation
+
+[source,pseudocode]
+----
+// Equivalent to two SRL operations on even/odd register pairs
+s1_lo  = X[rs1_p * 2]
+s1_hi  = X[rs1_p * 2 + 1]
+shamt  = X[rs2][4:0]
+
+d_lo = s1_lo >> shamt
+d_hi = s1_hi >> shamt
+
+X[rd_p * 2]     = d_lo
